# Force LF line endings for Unix-only script types, regardless of the
# committer's platform or core.autocrlf setting. Several of these scripts are
# consumed directly by CI (GitHub Actions macOS/Linux runners) and by Xcode
# Cloud's ci_post_clone.sh mechanism — CRLF line endings break execution
# there ("bad interpreter", corrupted `while read` loops).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.mk text eol=lf
